  "tips": {
    "transportation": "Buy a Trenitalia rail pass for unlimited train travel across Italy. Much cheaper than individual tickets. Venice uses vaporetto (water buses) - get a 3-day pass.",
    "language": "English is widely spoken in tourist areas, especially Rome, Venice, and Florence. Learn basic phrases: Grazie (thanks), Prego (welcome), Scusi (excuse me), Dov'è (Where is).",
